{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pilot starfighters with simulated cockpits and advanced hardware control as you fight to avoid blackout in close-quarter maneuvering fights of man over machine. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Wage war over a player-driven persistent universe during humanity's last great civil war while avoiding humanity's extinction by a mysterious alien threat. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mine resources and build a massive fleet to back up your starfighters as you fight for control over territory, resources, and key installations. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form organizations within each faction and build a personal fleet for you and your friends to command.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take a break from the war and participate in competitive races and wargames between friend and foe alike.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1512190/extras/cd606153c12335d0c46d048e08a75822.avif?t=1755777224\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1512190?t=1755777224","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/1512190?t=1755777224","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1512190/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755777224","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1512190/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755777224","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"MMO","id":20},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"VR Supported","id":